    "This update added:\n1. New Icon\n2. Localization\n\nFixed:\n1. No Button for Simultaneous\n2. Length should include displacement\n3. TextField length unification for iOS 17 & 18 on Simultaneous" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This update adds:\nNew icon\nLocalisation\n\nFixed:\nMissing button for Simultaneous\nLength should include displacement\nUnified TextField length for iOS 17 and iOS 18 in Simultaneous"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n1. 新图标\n2. 本地化\n\n修复：\n1. 二元一次方程组的解题按钮缺失\n2. 长度应包含矢量量\n3. 统一 iOS 17 和 18 中“二元一次方程组”模式下的文本框长度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本次更新新增：\n全新圖示\n多國語言支援\n\n修正：\n修正聯立方程式缺少按鈕的問題\n修正長度換算未包含位移單位的問題\n統一聯立方程式在 iOS 17 與 iOS 18 的文字輸入框長度"
